# Monorepo Structure

## Layout

```
ctxlite/
├── go/                     # Go HTTP proxy + cache (legacy binary)
├── npm/                    # Platform binary wrappers for Go release
├── packages/               # TypeScript workspace packages
│   ├── core/               → @ctxlite/core
│   ├── opencode/           → @ctxlite/opencode
│   ├── mcp/                → @ctxlite/mcp
│   └── cli/                → @ctxlite/cli
├── docs/
├── package.json            # root npm workspace
├── tsconfig.base.json
└── vitest.workspace.ts
```

## Packages
- `@ctxlite/core` — shared logic: BM25, SQLite stats, token counting, parser
- `@ctxlite/opencode` — OpenCode plugin
- `@ctxlite/mcp` — MCP stdio server for Cursor editor + Cursor agent CLI
- `@ctxlite/cli` — `ctxlite stats` and `ctxlite install` commands

## Rules
- Business logic ONLY in @ctxlite/core
- opencode and mcp packages import from core; do not duplicate logic
- CLI imports from core directly
- No circular dependencies between packages
- Go code lives in `go/`; npm binary wrappers in `npm/`

## Versioning
- All TypeScript packages share the same version (synchronized versioning)
- Version is defined once in root `package.json` as `config.version`
- The `sync-version` script propagates it to all packages
